754
00:28:22,937 --> 00:28:24,872
Mantenme a salvo de
la energía negativa.

755
00:28:24,973 --> 00:28:26,707
Hola a todos.
Bienvenidos a White Oak.

756
00:28:26,808 --> 00:28:29,642
