800
00:30:01,836 --> 00:30:03,135
Entendido.
De acuerdo, entendido.

801
00:30:03,236 --> 00:30:04,614
Bueno, Gloria,
me encantaría charlar...

802
00:30:04,638 --> 00:30:06,172
